# New self-study answer pages. Values are recomputed/asserted in guided_nums.py.
PRACTICE={
1:[
('先加總，再減門檻，等於零也放電','Sum, subtract the threshold, and fire at zero',[r'z=1+1+0=2',r'w_0=-\theta=-2,\quad s=z+w_0=2-2=0',r'o=\mathbf1[s\ge0]=1'],'本課採大於等於；輸出是一，不是零。','This course includes equality; the output is one.','先把三個輸入乘上權重一相加。偏置等於負門檻，減完恰為零。本課約定零也放電，因此輸出一。若採嚴格大於，答案會改變，所以平手約定必須先定。','All three weights are one. The bias is the negative threshold. The score is exactly zero, and this course includes equality, so the output is one. A strict inequality would change the answer.'),
('整數門檻取二；實數門檻有一整段可用','Choose two for an integer threshold; a real interval also works',[r'z=1\Rightarrow1-\theta<0\Rightarrow\theta>1',r'z=2\Rightarrow2-\theta\ge0\Rightarrow\theta\le2',r'1<\theta\le2'],'整數解是二；不要誤稱實數解只有二。','Two is the integer choice, not the only real threshold.','至少兩路為一時才放電，要求總和一不能放電、總和二要放電。兩條不等式合起來是1<theta<=2。如果門檻限制為整數，唯一解才是二。','Reject a sum of one and accept a sum of two. These give 1<theta<=2. Only when thresholds are restricted to integers is two the unique choice.'),
('正權重使分數單調，無法把一翻成零','Positive weights make the score monotone, so NOT is impossible',[r'w>0\Rightarrow s(1)-s(0)=w>0',r'o(0)=1\Rightarrow s(0)\ge0\Rightarrow s(1)>0',r'\operatorname{NOT}:\quad w=-1,\quad w_0=0.5'],'NOT 需要反向影響；負權重提供這個方向。','NOT needs an inhibitory direction, supplied by a negative weight.','若單一輸入從零升到一，正權重只會增加分數；本來放電就不會變成不放電。反例使用負權重一、偏置0.5，零時正分、一時負分。這是人工模型的方向例子，不是完整生理機制。','Raising an input cannot reduce a positive-weight score. If zero already fires, one cannot stop firing. A weight of -1 and bias 0.5 implements NOT in this artificial model.')],
2:[
('這筆猜成一，更新後改判零','This sample is predicted as one; the update makes it zero',[r's=1\cdot1+1\cdot0-1=0,\quad o=1',r'e=0-1=-1,\quad\mathbf w^+=(1,1,-1)-(1,0,1)=(0,1,-2)',r's^+=0\cdot1+1\cdot0-2=-2,\quad o^+=0'],'增廣輸入最後一項是一，偏置也必須更新。','The augmented input ends in one, so the bias updates too.','原分數零依約定判一，但標籤是零，因此誤差負一。把增廣向量(1,0,1)減掉，第二條權重因輸入零保持不動，偏置也減一。新分數負二，判對這一筆。','The zero score predicts one, but the target is zero. Subtract the augmented vector (1,0,1). The second weight stays fixed because its input is zero, while the bias decreases. The new score is -2.'),
('倒序訪問時，第一個錯誤在第四筆','With reverse ordering, the first mistake is sample four',[r'\mathbf w=\mathbf0\Rightarrow s=0,\quad o=1',r'y=(1,1,1,0),\quad e=(0,0,0,-1)',r'(0,0)\text{ is the first update}'],'前三筆標籤都是一，所以仍維持零權重。','The first three targets are one, so the zero weights persist.','依序訪問11、10、01、00。前三筆的標籤與零分數的輸出一相同，不更新。第四筆00標籤零才第一次猜錯。順序會影響軌跡。','Visit 11,10,01,00. The first three targets match the initial prediction of one. The first update occurs on 00, the fourth visit. Ordering affects the trajectory.'),
('零初值下，正倍數學習率只縮放軌跡','From zero, a positive rate scaling rescales the trajectory',[r'\mathbf w^{(2)}_0=2\mathbf w^{(1)}_0=\mathbf0',r'\mathbf w^{(2)+}=2\mathbf w^{(1)}+2e\mathbf x=2\mathbf w^{(1)+}',r'\operatorname{sign}(2s)=\operatorname{sign}(s)'],'同順序、同平手約定與零初值，是這個結論的條件。','Same order, tie rule and zero initialization are essential here.','用歸納法：兩組權重若相差正二倍，分數同號，誤差相同；更新率也相差二倍，下一組權重仍相差二倍。非零初值若沒有同倍縮放，就不能直接套這個結論。','Inductively, twice-scaled weights have the same predictions and errors. Twice the learning rate preserves the weight scaling after every update. Arbitrary unscaled nonzero initializations need not behave this way.')],
3:[
('偏置也更新後，新分數是一點五','Updating the bias too gives a new score of 1.5',[r's=1\cdot1+1\cdot0-1.5=-0.5,\quad o=-1',r'2\eta=1:\quad\mathbf w^+=(2,1),\quad w_0^+=-0.5',r's^+=2\cdot1+1\cdot0-0.5=1.5'],'分數增加二，包含偏置輸入一的貢獻。','The score increases by two, including the constant bias input.','這筆正類原先分錯。用2eta等於一，把y乘輸入加到權重，也把一加到偏置。新分數1.5。增量2eta*(||x||平方+1)=2，不能漏掉偏置項。','The positive point is misclassified. With 2 eta=1, add y times the input and also update the bias. The new score is 1.5; its increase of two includes the augmented constant input.'),
('法向量長五，距離就是一','The normal has length five, giving distance one',[r'\|\mathbf w\|_2=\sqrt{3^2+4^2}=5',r's(0,0)=-5',r'd=\frac{|s|}{\|\mathbf w\|_2}=\frac55=1'],'真實幾何距離必須除以空間權重範數。','True geometric distance divides by the spatial weight norm.','原分數是負五，不代表距離負五或五；距離非負，要取絕對值再除以法向量長度五。範數只取空間權重3、4，不把偏置負五併進平面法向量長度。','The score is -5, not the geometric distance. Take its absolute value and divide by the spatial normal length, five. Do not include the bias in that spatial norm.'),
('兩種正負一相減，只能得到零或正負二','Subtracting two signed labels gives zero or plus/minus two',[r'1-1=0,\quad(-1)-(-1)=0',r'1-(-1)=2,\quad(-1)-1=-2',r'o\ne y\Rightarrow y-o=2y'],'二倍因子來自編碼；只在錯分時使用。','The factor two comes from coding and applies on mistakes.','四種配對列完就能看出沒有正負一。猜對差零，猜錯時兩者反號，差為兩倍標籤。把所有點都套2eta yx會錯，正確點仍應不更新。','Equal labels and outputs subtract to zero. Opposite signs give plus or minus two, or twice the target. The mistaken-sample condition must remain in the rule.')],
4:[
('XNOR 的四條條件會互相矛盾','The four XNOR inequalities contradict one another',[r'w_0\ge0,\quad w_1+w_2+w_0\ge0',r'w_2+w_0<0,\quad w_1+w_0<0',r'w_1+w_2+2w_0<0\Rightarrow w_1+w_2+w_0<-w_0\le0'],'與十一必須非負矛盾，所以單一仿射門檻無解。','This contradicts the required nonnegative score at 11.','負類01與10的條件相加，再利用00正類要求偏置非負，推出11分數嚴格負。它卻必須非負，矛盾。包含等號和嚴格不等號的方向都不能改。','Add the negative-class inequalities for 01 and 10. Since 00 requires nonnegative bias, the score at 11 must be strictly negative, contradicting its positive label.'),
('AND 的正類能被直線隔開，XOR 不能','A line separates AND, but not XOR',[r'\operatorname{AND}:\quad s=x_1+x_2-1.5',r's(1,1)=0.5,\quad s(0,1)=s(1,0)=-0.5',r'\operatorname{conv}(C_0)\cap\operatorname{conv}(C_1)\ne\varnothing\quad(\operatorname{XOR})'],'差別在表示能力，不在資料點有幾筆。','The difference is representation, not the number of samples.','AND只有11為正，一條線就能留在正方形一角；XOR正負類的對角線凸包在中心相交，沒有一條仿射直線能分離兩者。這不表示其他非線性模型也做不到。','AND has one positive corner, isolated by a line. XOR’s class convex hulls intersect at the centre, preventing affine separation. Nonlinear models are not subject to the same limitation.'),
('用獨立驗證比較，最後才看測試集','Compare on validation data and reserve a final test set',[],'訓練全對不能排出誰會泛化較好。','Perfect training predictions cannot rank generalization.','先保留與未來用途相符、未用於訓練的驗證資料比較候選模型，決定後再用獨立測試資料評估。不反覆用測試集挑模型，也不只靠邊界圖看起來居中就宣稱較好。','Compare candidates on representative held-out validation data, then evaluate the selected model on an independent test set. Repeatedly choosing on the test set leaks information. A visually central boundary alone is not generalization evidence.')],
5:[
('三個閘依序前饋，得到 XOR 的一','Three forward gates produce XOR output one',[r's_1=1+0-1=0,\quad h_1=1',r's_2=-1-0+1.5=0.5,\quad h_2=1',r's_3=1+1-2=0,\quad o=1'],'每一層都用同一個零分數判一的約定。','All layers use the same convention: zero predicts one.','先算OR單元與NAND單元，輸入10使兩者都放電，再交給AND。最後分數恰為零，因此仍輸出一。中間反應是由原輸入計算的新座標，不是新標籤。','Input 10 activates both OR and NAND hidden units. AND then has score zero and outputs one under the stated tie rule. Hidden responses are computed features, not extra labels.'),
('兩個矩陣相乘，合併成三與二','The matrix product merges to three and two',[r'\mathbf W_1=\begin{pmatrix}1&0\\1&1\end{pmatrix},\quad\mathbf W_2=(1,2)',r'\mathbf W_2\mathbf W_1=(1+2,0+2)=(3,2)',r'y=3x_1+2x_2'],'沒有中間非線性時，可以直接合併運算。','Without an intervening nonlinearity, the transformations merge.','先把一乘第一列加二乘第二列，得到(3,2)。這是矩陣的合成，不是逐元素相乘。此題沒有偏置；有偏置時合併後通常是仿射映射。','Multiply matrices by forming the weighted sum of rows, giving (3,2), not an elementwise product. This exercise has no biases; with biases the merged map is generally affine.'),
('十個線性映射相乘，仍是一個線性映射','Ten linear maps still compose to one linear map',[r'\mathbf W_{\rm eff}=\mathbf W_{10}\cdots\mathbf W_2\mathbf W_1',r'\mathbf y=\mathbf W_{\rm eff}\mathbf x'],'含偏置時是仿射；深度本身不產生非線性。','Biases give an affine map; depth alone does not create nonlinearity.','恆等活化沒有打斷矩陣合成，所以十層可合併。若每層含偏置，可遞迴得到有效偏置，整體仍是仿射。瓶頸維度還可能限制有效矩陣的秩，不能說所有參數配置與任意寬單層的表示集合完全相同。','Identity activations do not interrupt matrix composition. Biases combine into an effective affine offset. Bottlenecks may constrain rank, so not every architecture has exactly the same representable set as an unconstrained wide single layer.')],
6:[
('Sigmoid 在一的值約零點七三一，導數約零點一九七','At one, sigmoid is about 0.731 and its derivative about 0.197',[r'\sigma(1)=\frac1{1+e^{-1}}\approx0.731058579',r'\sigma\prime(1)=\sigma(1)(1-\sigma(1))\approx0.196611933',r'0.196611933<0.25'],'中間值保留完整精度，最後才取小數。','Keep full intermediate precision and round only at the end.','先算sigmoid再用同一個完整值求導數。來源把0.3679與0.7311當中間值是四捨五入展示，這裡不把它們當精確常數。導數低於零處的最大值四分之一。','Compute the sigmoid and then use that full value in its derivative. Rounded source decimals are displays, not exact intermediate constants. The derivative is below the maximum one quarter.'),
('相同分數經 Softmax，得到均勻三分布','Equal logits give a uniform three-class softmax',[r'p_j=\frac{e^1}{e^1+e^1+e^1}=\frac13',r'\mathbf p=(1/3,1/3,1/3),\quad\sum_jp_j=1'],'共同平移分數，不會改變 Softmax。','A common logit shift does not change softmax.','三個分子相同、分母是同一數的三倍，所以每個機率三分之一。這不是三個獨立sigmoid，也不是每個輸出都等於一。','Each numerator is the same and the denominator is three times it, giving one third per class. These are not independent sigmoids and the outputs are not all one.'),
('ReLU 的負側擋住梯度，Leaky 留下一條小斜率','ReLU blocks the negative-side gradient; Leaky leaves a slope',[r'a<0:\quad f_{\rm ReLU}(a)=0,\quad f\prime_{\rm ReLU}(a)=0',r'f_{\rm Leaky}(a)=\alpha a,\quad f\prime_{\rm Leaky}(a)=\alpha,\quad\alpha=0.01'],'Leaky 提供非零局部導數，不保證整網路永不梯度消失。','A nonzero local derivative is not a network-wide gradient guarantee.','若此單元對全部樣本都在負側，普通鏈式梯度經ReLU會歸零。Leaky保留0.01的斜率，但其他層、上游梯度或資料問題仍可使更新很小。正則化或其他機制也可能更新參數，不能無條件說任何情況下權重永遠不變。','If every example is on the negative side, the ordinary gradient through ReLU vanishes. Leaky keeps a slope of 0.01, but other layers and upstream gradients can still make updates tiny. Other mechanisms, such as regularization, may also update parameters.')],
7:[
('同一組殘差，三種加總得到不同的尺','Three sums measure the same residuals differently',[r'\sum e_i^2=2^2+(-1)^2+0.5^2+6^2=41.25',r'\sum|e_i|=2+1+0.5+6=9.5',r'\sum h_1(e_i)=(2-0.5)+0.5+0.5(0.5)^2+(6-0.5)=7.625'],'這裡明確計加總；平均各自再除以四。','These are sums; divide each by four for means.','對Huber先判斷絕對殘差是否超過一。四項依序1.5、0.5、0.125、5.5，再相加為7.625。來源把平方加總稱MSE容易混淆，若採mean則為10.3125；MAE平均2.375、Huber平均1.90625。不同尺的數字不直接比較優劣。','Huber terms are 1.5,0.5,0.125,5.5, summing to 7.625. The source calls a squared sum MSE; the corresponding mean is 10.3125. Mean absolute and Huber losses are 2.375 and 1.90625. Different loss scales cannot be ranked by raw magnitude.'),
('三個零分數的交叉熵是自然對數三','Three zero logits give cross-entropy ln three',[r'p_j=\frac{e^0}{e^0+e^0+e^0}=\frac13',r'\ell=-\ln(1/3)=\ln3\approx1.098612289'],'互斥三類、one-hot 標籤，任選正類結果相同。','For mutually exclusive classes and a one-hot target, each class gives the same loss.','先算softmax均勻分布，再取正確類別機率的負自然對數。不要把sigmoid(0)=0.5用在三類softmax，也不要把負對數寫成負三分之一。','Compute the uniform softmax and take the negative natural log of the correct-class probability. Sigmoid(0)=0.5 is not the three-class answer.'),
('負標籤遇正分數，Hinge 損失是一點八','A negative label with a positive score has hinge loss 1.8',[r'yf_o=(-1)(0.8)=-0.8',r'\ell=\max(0,1-(-0.8))=1.8'],'分數符號與標籤相反，這筆確實分錯。','The score and target have opposite signs, so classification is wrong.','先把標籤乘分數，得到負0.8，再用1減它，得到1.8。負乘正是負，不能漏負號。此處的margin是一個分數門檻，不是已除以權重範數的幾何距離。','Multiply target and score first: -0.8. Then the hinge is max(0,1.8)=1.8. This margin is a score threshold, not automatically a normalized geometric distance.')],
8:[
('第二批的梯度是負零點八、負零點八、負一','The second batch gradient is (-0.8,-0.8,-1)',[r'\hat{\mathbf y}=(0.3,0.5,0.5,0.7),\quad\mathbf r=(-0.3,0.5,0.5,0.3)',r'\mathbf g=-(\sum r_ix_{i1},\sum r_ix_{i2},\sum r_i)=(-0.8,-0.8,-1)',r'\mathbf w^+=(0.2,0.2,0.3)-0.1\mathbf g=(0.28,0.28,0.4)'],'這裡採半平方誤差總和；平均時尺度要另對齊。','This uses the half squared-error sum; a mean has a different scale.','先重新前饋四筆OR輸入，不能沿用第一批的預測。殘差定義是目標減預測，因此損失梯度加一個負號。偏置輸入一使其梯度為負殘差總和。完整新損失為0.1832，講義0.183是取位。','Recompute predictions for all four OR samples. Residuals are target minus prediction, so the loss gradient has a minus sign. The bias uses constant input one. The new exact loss is 0.1832; 0.183 is rounded.'),
('先算分數零點四，再換成機率','Compute score 0.4, then convert to probability',[r's=-1.2+0.8\cdot2=0.4',r'p=\frac1{1+e^{-0.4}}\approx0.598687660'],'零點四是分數，不是輸出機率。','The score 0.4 is not the probability.','偏置放參數第一項，第二項乘x。代入得到0.4，再經sigmoid得到約0.599。若用0.5機率門檻，這筆會判為一；分類門檻是另一個選擇。','The first parameter is the bias and the second multiplies x. The score is 0.4 and sigmoid gives about 0.599. A probability threshold of 0.5 would predict one.'),
('連續輸出不是類別，分類還要做決策','A continuous score still needs a classification decision',[r'\hat y=\mathbf w^\top\mathbf x',r'\hat c=\mathbf1[\hat y\ge0.5]'],'零點五對應本例零一標籤，不是所有編碼的固定門檻。','A threshold of 0.5 matches this zero–one coding, not every encoding.','ADALINE訓練平方誤差，輸出不限制在零一之間，甚至可以超過一。分類時另外選門檻；本例0/1標籤取0.5，換編碼或成本可用不同決策。','ADALINE fits a squared-error score that can lie outside [0,1]. Classification adds a threshold. Here 0.5 matches zero–one labels, but other codings or costs can justify other decisions.')],
9:[
('中點到兩中心的平方距離都是二分之一','The midpoint has squared distance one half to both centres',[r'd_1^2=0.5^2+0.5^2=0.5,\quad d_2^2=(-0.5)^2+(-0.5)^2=0.5',r'\phi_1=\phi_2=e^{-0.5}\approx0.606530660',r'\phi_1+\phi_2=2e^{-0.5}\approx1.213061319'],'兩個反應相同，不代表等於零點五。','Equal responses do not mean a response of 0.5.','中心是手選、二倍變異數等於一。先算平方距離再取負指數，得到兩個約0.607的反應。若沿用XOR模型的分界約0.935547，這個和在類別零的一側；但它不是原四筆XOR之一。','The centres are hand-picked and twice the variance is one. Apply the negative exponential to each squared distance, giving about 0.607. Their sum lies on the class-zero side of the XOR fit, though the midpoint is not one of the original four XOR samples.'),
('第二個原型勝出，向輸入移動一半','Prototype two wins and moves halfway toward the input',[r'd_1=\sqrt{0.8^2+0.6^2}=1',r'd_2=\sqrt{(-0.2)^2+(-0.4)^2}\approx0.447213595',r'\mathbf w_2^+=(1,1)+0.5(-0.2,-0.4)=(0.9,0.8)'],'這題只更新勝者，第一個原型仍是零向量。','Only the winner updates here; prototype one remains the zero vector.','兩個距離使用更新前權重比較，第二顆較近。題目明說只更新勝者，所以不把KP09主算例的左鄰居也一起改。更新是與輸入的凸組合，移到0.9、0.8。','Compare distances using the old prototypes. The second is closer. This exercise updates only the winner, so do not import the neighbour update from the main example. A half-step gives (0.9,0.8).'),
('固定特徵時，待求權重才是線性問題','Fixed features make the unknown output weights a linear problem',[r'\hat{\mathbf Y}=\mathbf W^\top\Phi',r'\Phi\Phi^\top\mathbf W=\Phi\mathbf Y^\top'],'先固定基函數；奇異時仍需偽逆或穩定求解。','Fix the bases first; singular systems need a pseudoinverse or stable solver.','RBF本課設計先固定中心與寬度，只有W未知，損失是權重的二次函數。MLP若所有層都未知，隱藏輸出也跟參數變動，通常不是同一個線性最小二乘問題。一般RBF也有學中心的變體，這個說法限定本課流程。','In this course, centres and widths are fixed before fitting W, giving a quadratic objective in the unknown output weights. If all MLP layers are unknown, the hidden features also depend on parameters, so the problem is generally nonlinear. Some other RBF training schemes also adjust centres.')]
}
QUIZ_KEYS={1:[2,1,1,2],2:[1,1,1,1],3:[2,1,None,0],4:[1,2,1,1],5:[1,2,1,1],6:[1,2,1,1],7:[1,1,2,1],8:[1,1,1,0,1,0,0,1],9:[1,1,1,2]}
QUIZ_NOTES={
1:[('細胞體整合訊號；樹突接收，軸突傳出，突觸連接。','The soma integrates; dendrites receive, the axon transmits and synapses connect.'),('人工模型保留加總與門檻的計算抽象，不模擬代謝或DNA複製。','The model abstracts summation and thresholding, not metabolism or DNA replication.'),('本課沿用McCulloch與Pitts，1943；其他選項分別是後續模型或討論。','The handout credits McCulloch and Pitts, 1943; the alternatives refer to later developments.'),('本單元f是二元階梯，其他連續活化在KP06另談。','Here f is a binary step; later units discuss other activations.')],
2:[('本課沿用Rosenblatt，1958，當時位於Cornell Aeronautical Laboratory。','The handout credits Rosenblatt, 1958, at Cornell Aeronautical Laboratory.'),('學習規則使用正確標籤與預測誤差，是監督式；不能等同古典無監督Hebbian規則。','Labels and prediction errors make this supervised, unlike a classical unsupervised Hebbian rule.'),('y-o為零，整個修正量為零，不是把學習率改成零。','When y-o=0 the correction vanishes; the learning rate itself is not set to zero.'),('同一個形式在b=1時去掉求和；但大批次同步更新不保證與逐筆軌跡相同。','For b=1 the sum disappears; a simultaneous batch need not match the sequential trajectory.')],
3:[('Signum輸出正一或負一，本課零分數取正一。','Signum outputs plus or minus one; this course assigns plus one to a zero score.'),('只在錯分時o=-y，所以y-o=2y。','On mistakes o=-y, hence y-o=2y.'),('原題前提需要更正：真距離是|s|除以空間權重範數；錯分且ys<0時|s|=-ys，不是ys。固定錯分集合下可去絕對值分支求梯度，但不等於把正距離直接改成ys。','The premise needs correction: true distance is |s| divided by the spatial norm, and when ys<0, |s|=-ys, not ys. Fixing a mistaken set permits a branch derivative, not replacing positive distance by ys.'),('在固定錯分集合、未正規化分數準則與對齊學習率下，兩種方向可對應；不是一般正規化幾何距離的梯度都相同。','The directions correspond for a fixed mistaken set and unnormalized score criterion with matched rates, not for arbitrary normalized geometric-distance gradients.')],
4:[('有限步收斂保證要求線性可分二元資料、固定正學習率及一致約定；非可分資料無此保證。','The finite-convergence guarantee assumes separable binary data, a fixed positive rate and a consistent rule.'),('沿用講義XOR反例；它揭示單一仿射門檻的表示限制，不代表所有神經網路無法解。','The XOR example exposes a single affine threshold’s limitation, not a limitation of every network.'),('不同初值與順序可能停在不同可分邊界；僅憑訓練全對不能判定泛化。','Initializations and ordering can yield different separating boundaries; perfect training accuracy does not establish generalization.'),('B是目標的改變：ADALINE用LMS連續損失。但這不保證一定比Perceptron泛化好，原題的「改善泛化靠什麼」已釐清為目標差異。','B identifies the changed objective: continuous LMS loss. This does not guarantee better generalization; the source’s stronger premise is corrected.')],
5:[('前饋是計算時訊號往後層傳遞；訓練時反傳梯度不是前饋架構中的循環連接。','Feedforward computation moves toward outputs; backpropagating gradients does not create recurrent architecture links.'),('C依本課層數約定解讀：輸入提供資料，不算可訓練運算層；不能把「無作用」解成資料沒有作用。','Under this counting convention the input supplies data but is not a trainable computation layer; it is not useless.'),('無偏置時合併為線性映射，有偏置則仿射；中間瓶頸可能限制有效矩陣秩。','The composition is linear without biases and affine with them; bottlenecks may limit effective rank.'),('非線性打破線性合成的坍縮；但還需要適當寬度與參數，並不因此保證學得到。','Nonlinearity prevents linear collapse, but sufficient width and suitable parameters are still required, without a learning guarantee.')],
6:[('ReLU正側局部導數一不逐層縮小，負側歸零帶稀疏；仍不能保證整網路無梯度消失。','The positive-side derivative one avoids that local shrinkage and negative outputs become zero, but network-wide gradients are not guaranteed.'),('Softmax跨指定類別軸共同正規化；逐點sigmoid、tanh、ReLU不同。','Softmax jointly normalizes along the class axis, unlike pointwise sigmoid, tanh or ReLU.'),('負區間普通反傳梯度為零可能使單元失活；不代表任何正則化或共享路徑都不能改參數。','Zero negative-side gradients can deactivate the unit; other mechanisms may still affect parameters.'),('PReLU的負側斜率可學，Leaky通常固定；0.01是本課例值，不是唯一合法固定值。','PReLU learns the negative slope; Leaky usually fixes it. The course’s 0.01 is an example, not the only valid slope.')],
7:[('平方放大大殘差，使離群值主導；不是不能用於回歸，也不是零點不可導。','Squaring emphasizes large residuals and outliers; it is differentiable at zero and usable for regression.'),('delta決定平方區與線性區的切換位置，不是學習率或類別數。','Delta selects the quadratic-to-linear transition, not the learning rate or class count.'),('KL比較目標與預測分布，適用軟標籤；交叉熵也可用，題目只在列出的四項中選。','KL compares target and predicted distributions and suits soft labels; cross-entropy can too, but is not an offered alternative.'),('互斥多類用正規化向量；二元只需p及補數1-p。單一sigmoid輸出不需自己和為一；實作也可直接接logits再做穩定組合損失。','Exclusive multiclass uses a normalized vector; binary uses p and 1-p. One sigmoid output need not itself sum to one. Stable fused losses may accept logits directly.')],
8:[('訓練比較連續加權和與標籤，門檻留到分類；不是sigmoid機率。','Training compares a continuous weighted sum with the target; thresholding is for classification.'),('使用本課半平方誤差總和，LMS亦常指逐筆最小均方更新，需對齊尺度。','The course uses a half squared-error sum; LMS also denotes online mean-square methods, so scaling conventions matter.'),('最小化用減梯度。最大化對數似然可用加梯度，但不是把損失的符號隨意改。','Minimization subtracts its gradient; likelihood maximization adds its own gradient.'),('沿用講義MRI1962到MRII1988的簡化範圍註記，不作完整架構或歷史考證。','Retain the handout’s simplified MRI1962/MRII1988 scope without claiming a full historical survey.'),('直接建模P(y|x)；LDA通常先建模類別條件輸入分布與先驗再求後驗。','Logistic directly models P(y|x); LDA generally models class-conditional inputs and priors first.'),('講義引用Verhulst1845人口成長作早期用途，不宣稱它是所有logistic形式的最早出現。','The handout cites Verhulst1845 population growth as an early use, not the first appearance of every logistic form.'),('一般牛頓式beta-H逆g；本例H=-XWX轉置，代入後才成加A逆g。','The generic Newton step is beta-H inverse g; substituting the negative likelihood Hessian gives plus A inverse g.'),('本例以p>=0.5判一，門檻可依成本調整，不看梯度零與否來分類。','This example predicts one at p>=0.5; costs may justify other thresholds. A zero gradient is not a class rule.')],
9:[('本課先由K-means與群內變異估參數後固定；一般RBF也有再學中心寬度的方案。','This course fixes centres and widths after a data-driven preparation; other RBF schemes may learn them further.'),('奇異時用偽逆得到最小範數最小二乘解；實作宜SVD等穩定方法。','A pseudoinverse gives a minimum-norm least-squares fit; stable methods such as SVD are preferable in code.'),('用輸入到資料空間原型的最小歐氏距離，不是格子距離或原型範數。','Select the minimum input-to-prototype Euclidean distance, not a grid distance or prototype norm.'),('題目指硬鄰域：鄰域內更新、外不動；來源圖的高斯軟鄰域則所有節點有正但可能極小的影響。','The question uses a hard neighbourhood; the source simulation’s Gaussian neighbourhood instead gives positive, possibly tiny, influence everywhere.')]
}
